  ✖ rebinding: sessions switch worktrees repeatedly and always end on the last one (3217.216792ms)
  ✔ crash: SIGKILLed owners are replaced at once; every mission is adopted by exactly one live custodian (3614.048666ms)
  ✖ truncated JSONL: writers killed mid-record are each repaired exactly once by concurrent replacements (2940.516583ms)
  ✔ corrupted metadata (missing/empty/partial/invalid JSON lock owners, garbage registry) never stops concurrent sessions (2778.874167ms)
