  ✔ randomized multi-process race: register/heartbeat/acquire/renew/release/rebind/reconcile/SIGKILL keep every invariant (2620.818625ms)
  ✖ double migration: many sessions importing the same legacy store at once produce one consistent import (2646.922791ms)
